## Starting question

> How does a connected republic determine which obligations survived the transition, which norms possess supreme authority, and who must support that order?

The complete research foundation for this public adaptation is available on Zenodo: [_Code Constitution_](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21894242).

